{"id": "34516", "title": "培养总裁", "author": "陈毓华", "category": "文学名著", "count": 44, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34516.htm", "intro": "呃，好吧，她没想到她钻狗洞的行为会被人发现，可是爹地说远亲不如近邻，就不要这么计较了嘛！不知道是不是每个情妇的儿子都跟她的新朋友一样寂寞，不过没关系，她会好好“照顾”他的！看见他苍白的肤色，她逼他打高尔夫运动，知道他讨厌接触人群，她丢了一堆书要他自修……但谁没有过去？两人早在他父亲带回他时就已经结束！十多年没见的人突然出现眼前，她没有一丝愉悦，只被吓得魂飞魄散。虽说他如今成为超大企业的总裁，她可是居功厥伟，不过现在她只是家道中落的小老百姓，两人的距离差了不止十万八千里！她跟他装不熟也是为了他好，可那个大老板──每天风雨无阻的跑来帮她卖早餐是怎样呀？……", "base": "files/article/html/34/34516", "chapters": [{"title": "第1页", "file": "2189921.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2189922.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2189923.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2189924.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2189925.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2189926.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2189927.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2189928.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2189929.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2189930.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2189931.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2189932.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2189933.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2189934.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2189935.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2189936.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2189937.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2189938.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2189939.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2189940.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2189941.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2189942.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2189943.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2189944.html", 